 or format evidence found in reviewed exact-edition and content sources."}],"work_id":1310,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":80,"text":"Harry begint aan zijn zesde jaar op Zweinstein terwijl Voldemorts invloed buiten de school steeds sterker voelbaar wordt. Rampen en onverklaarbare gebeurtenissen raken zowel de tovenaarswereld als de wereld van Dreuzels. Professor Perkamentus zoekt Harry op en betrekt hem bij zaken die niet kunnen wachten. Het naderende schooljaar krijgt daardoor een andere betekenis: lessen en dagelijks leven staan steeds nadrukkelijker in het teken van de dreiging daarbuiten.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/122562/harry-potter-en-de-halfbloed-prins.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022322338","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022322338"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1311,"title":"Harry Potter en de relieken van de dood","isbn_13":"9789022322338","isbn_10":"9022322335","language":"nld","publisher":"Harmonie, Uitgeverij De","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022322338","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022322338"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-006-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/122565/harry-potter-en-de-relieken-van-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/122565/harry-potter-en-de-relieken-van-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:36.158Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"840d117112858d65b60052219bf74ec37c66d547de5e54507021d34c44802138"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000103959_Harry_Potter_en_de_relieken_van_de_dood_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:30:4