 identity or format evidence found in reviewed exact-edition and content sources."}],"work_id":1311,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":80,"text":"Harry gaat niet terug naar Zweinstein. Hij probeert de opdracht te volbrengen die Perkamentus hem heeft nagelaten: de overgebleven Gruzielementen vinden en vernietigen. Het onderzoek vraagt om keuzes zonder de vertrouwde bescherming van school en leraren. Terwijl de dreiging groter wordt, moet Harry bepalen welke aanwijzingen betrouwbaar zijn en hoe hij verder kan gaan wanneer kennis ontbreekt en de tijd om te handelen beperkt is.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/122565/harry-potter-en-de-relieken-van-de-dood.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024582112","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024582112"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1313,"title":"Leviathan ontwaakt","isbn_13":"9789024582112","isbn_10":"9024582113","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024582112","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024582112"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-006-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/506486/leviathan-ontwaakt.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/506486/leviathan-ontwaakt.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:38.205Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"624e0411041d0fa62239af87430a07bd5bcbed78e3523460c70099e402b60296"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000523805_Leviathan_ontwaakt_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:30:50.082Z","http":200,"sha256":"4912d5f7aba4367594ffd8467c503ff5f677ed7c357a113eaa726e1cfea53