elsel verspreid, maar de verhoudingen tussen Aarde, Mars en de bewoners van de asteroïdengordel zijn gespannen. Jim Holden stuit met zijn bemanning op een verlaten ruimteschip en ontdekt iets dat die broze vrede verder kan ontregelen. Hun vondst trekt hen een conflict in waarin politieke belangen en onbekende gevaren moeilijk van elkaar te scheiden zijn.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/506486/leviathan-ontwaakt.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024565535","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024565535"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1314,"title":"Calibans strijd","isbn_13":"9789024565535","isbn_10":"9024565537","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024565535","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024565535"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-006-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/439716/calibans-strijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/439716/calibans-strijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:40.319Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"8a81281ed9a2ba8aaff2f3fc5adc4ab414f38abf760d1a5a9456344864b57aa1"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000374950_Calibans_strijd_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:30:51.902Z","http":200,"sha256":"2ffa330df3df1f55e7393f0c1353218540aa136ee7c8c928b06ac2e6b372c9a4","bytes":87193,"fact":"Full source image decoded and inspected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"James Corey on Dutch publisher metadata and James S.A.Corey on Work are the same established author pseudonym."}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024565535","work_id":1314,"bound_author_id":130,"bound_title":"Calibans strijd","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024565535","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000374950_Calibans_strijd_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/439716/calibans-strijd.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1314:nl","key":{"work_id":1314,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-006-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/439716/calibans-strijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/439716/calibans-strijd.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:40.319Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"8a81281ed9a2ba8aaff2f3fc5adc4ab414f38abf760d1a5a9456344864b57aa1"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000374950_Calibans_strijd_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:30:51.902Z","http":200,"sha256":"2ffa330df3df1f55e7393f0c1353218540aa136ee7c8c928b06ac2e6b372c9a4","bytes":87193,"fact":"Full source image decoded and inspected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"James Corey on Dutch publisher metadata and James S.A.Corey on Work are the same established author pseudonym."}],"work_id":1314,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":130,"text":"Een gewelddadige aanval op Ganymedes dreigt de spanningen tussen de menselijke machten opnieuw te laten escaleren. Terwijl een politica op Aarde oorlog probeert te voorkomen, ontstaan op Venus raadselachtige veranderingen. Holden en zijn bemanning raken betrokken bij de zoektocht naar een vermist kind. Hun hulpactie brengt hen dichter bij een dreiging die veel verder reikt dan één maan of één politieke tegenstander.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/439716/calibans-strijd.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789056721787","key":{"isbn_13":"9789056721787"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1321,"title":"Gerechtigheid","isbn_13":"9789056721787","isbn_10":"905672178X","language":"nld","publisher":"Bruna BV Uitgaven","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789056721787","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789056721787"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-006-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://www.awbruna.nl/boek/thrillers/stieg-larsson/gerechtigheid-millennium/","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/294846/gerechtigheid.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:46.333Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"7772c786fda0d9f9fb7d1905d4ee9c0b71cc17e178af50ef46bcd74bf2a0833d"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000109037_Gerechtigheid_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:30:53.698Z","http":200,"sha256":"331544871d64cb72cd25992c3dceea339f3f6e008f899c15822e44004ff5814c","bytes":77783,"fact":"Full source image decoded and inspected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"No conflicting identity or format evidence found in reviewed exact-edition and content sources."}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789056721787","work_id":1321,"bound_author_id":40,"bound_title":"Gerechtigheid","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789056721787","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isb