ijn metgezellen op zoek. De naderende winterzonnewende maakt haast noodzakelijk, want Artemis kan een beslissende rol spelen in de strijd met de Titanen. Het orakel heeft de groep bovendien gewaarschuwd dat hun tocht slachtoffers zal eisen. Percy probeert de vermisten te vinden terwijl zijn dromen en de voorspelling de onzekerheid onderweg vergroten.","source_type":"official_publisher","source_name":"www.lannoo.com","source_url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-be/young-adult/de-vloek-van-de-titaan-9789022555026","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022560822","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022560822"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1325,"title":"De laatste Olympier","isbn_13":"9789022560822","isbn_10":"9022560821","language":"nld","publisher":"Uitgeverij Unieboek | Het Spectrum","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022560822","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022560822"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-006-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1751794/de-laatste-olympier.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1751794/de-laatste-olympier.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:26:23.018Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"d019081ad6c4e9142a8309cafbbaacfb1d3a1d2481734bbf7002a76e2eb74878"},{"url":"https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.441331610.html/de-laatste-olympie-r/","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Independent explicit exact-ISBN Dutch-language/translation evidence overriding conflicting Bureau label"},{"url":"https://www.lannoo.com/nl-be/young-adult/de-laatste-olympier-9789022560822","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Independent explicit exact-ISBN Dutch-language/translation evidence overri